- `v2/backend/tests/services/symbol_universe/test_coverage_buckets.py` (invariant proof)
- `v2/frontend/public/operator_runtime/symbol_universe_coverage/latest/missing_dynamic_symbol_coverage.json` (operator snapshot)

## Constraints honored

- No legacy tree mutation.
- No old-Redis writes from any emitted code.
- No exchange call.
- No leverage / margin change.
- No paper / training symbol auto-enrollment.
- No live-gate flip; default-deny middleware unchanged.
- All emitted files inside the `allowed_output_prefixes` of the task descriptor.

## Next action

After Codex review of this gate, run the source-feed remediation tasks
(`missing_ingestor_service`, `stale_ingestor_payload`,
`missing_v2_namespace_mapping`) and then re-fire this report so the source
matrix flips BLOCKED→PASS rows. The committed `coverage_buckets.py` module
